# Desperate Measures: "this turn" is the turn it was cast. Bot1's Ornithopter becomes 1/1 and lives; it is back to 0/2 on turn
# 3, where Bot1 bolts it and draws no cards from the delayed ability (the turn-3 draw is the only one).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Desperate Measures
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Forest
Forest
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Desperate Measures.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
